>How do you steal using the dog?  (We have one; so far it's only been
>good for killing pesky monsters.)

SPOILERS AHEAD...

What you do is walk one step into the shop, pushing the dog in front
of you.  Then you drop a tripe ration on that square, and step back
into the doorway.  Let the dog come eat the tripe ration.  When you do
this, your dog is 'trained' to retrieve items out of the shop and
leave them on *that* square.  This is important, as all items found on
that first square are *free*!  So your dog clears out the shop, and
the shopkeeper is none the wiser.  An added effect to this: The dog
will NOT pick up cursed items...so anything he gives you is curse
free!

Remember though...when you are the Hand of Elbereth, this won't work,
as the shopkeeper will stay put in the doorway.

